<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Insiyab.Avalonia</RootNamespace>
    <PackageId>Insiyab.Avalonia</PackageId>
    <Version>0.2.0</Version>
    <Title>Insiyab for Avalonia</Title>
    <Authors>Mohammad Diab</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright 2026 Mohammad Diab</Copyright>
    <Description>Insiyab for Avalonia: the glass, RTL-first design system as Avalonia themes.</Description>
    <PackageTags>avalonia;theme;design-system;controls;rtl;arabic;ui</PackageTags>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Mohammad-Diab/insiyab-ui/tree/main/packages/avalonia</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Mohammad-Diab/insiyab-ui</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.5.1

Added
- Wizard: `EnterFillsFields` makes Enter in a field go to the step's next empty required field before it moves on or finishes, and gives the step's one-line text fields a touch keyboard's "next" key (the last one "done"). `KeyboardEcho` ignores the Enter that a touch keyboard sends right after its "next" key moved the focus, as Android's keyboard does.
- Pull to refresh: `RefreshProgress.Value` on the `RefreshContainer` (0 to 1) turns the turning ring of a refresh under way into a ring that fills to the work done; `NaN` (the default) keeps the turning ring.
- The `warning` class on the message under a field: the error line's look in the warn tone, with the warn alert's triangle.

Fixed
- A menu or select row no longer shakes when the pointer rests on its start edge, where the hover nudge slid the row from under the pointer.
- A menu's items rise in through their template, so their entrance no longer fights the hover nudge when the pointer crosses a menu that is still opening; a row could keep the entrance's 6px drop.

The full list of 0.5.0 changes is on the 0.5.0 release.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageIcon>mark-128.png</PackageIcon>
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
    <IsTrimmable>true</IsTrimmable>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia" Version="$(AvaloniaVersion)" />
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia.Themes.Fluent" Version="$(AvaloniaVersion)" />
    <!-- D-Bus for NotifyAreaIcon on Linux (a StatusNotifierItem): the version Avalonia.FreeDesktop brings, managed and AOT-safe -->
    <PackageReference Include="Tmds.DBus.Protocol" Version="0.94.1" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Insiyab.Avalonia.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="PerfLab" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <AvaloniaResource Include="Assets\**" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\..\..\brand\mark-128.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" Visible="false" />
    <None Include="..\..\..\..\NOTICE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" Visible="false" />
    <None Include="Assets\Fonts\OFL-*.txt" Pack="true" PackagePath="fonts\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
